<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n24545" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δια-βήτης</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ου</span>, ὁ, (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">διαβαίνω</span>) <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>compass,</i> so called from its
			outstretched legs, <i><span class="en">
				Ar.
				<u>Nu.</u>
				178
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Av.</u>
				1003
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>carpenter's</i> or <i>stonemason's rule,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ξύσας ὀρθὸν πρὸς διαβήτην</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>IG</u>
					12(2).11.20
				</span></i>
			 (<span class="entity">Lesbos</span>), cf. ib.<i><span class="en">
				2.1054.10
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>Phlb.</u>
				56b
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				2.802f
			</span></i>, Sch.<i><span class="en">
				Il.
				2.765
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>siphon,</i> Colum.<i><span class="en">
				3.10
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Hero
				<u>Spir.</u>
				1.29
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>III.</b> Medic., the
			disease <i>diabetes,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Aret.
				<u>SD</u>
				2.2
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Philagr.
			</span></i> ap. <i><span class="en">
				Orib.
				5.19.9
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Gal.
				8.394
			</span></i>.</div>
